			(property "ki_fp_filters" "M3_TestPad_1.5"
				(at 0 0 0)
				(effects
					(font
						(size 1.27 1.27))
					(hide yes))))
	)
	(text "15 | GNSS and telemetry radio (R7): u-blox MAX-F10S U30 and EBYTE E22-900MM22S U31 on main 3V3 through FB30/FB31; aft RF strip, one edge SMA each (REQUIREMENTS F10)."
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05))
			(justify left))
		(uuid 305290e4-81e3-5359-a137-f13376eec927))
	(text "GNSS on USART6: PC6 TX -> R306 220R -> RXD; TXD -> R305 220R -> PC7 RX. PD14 drives RESET_N open-drain (no pull, no capacitor). TIMEPULSE -> R307 1k -> PD15 (TIM4_CH4 capture), never pulled down (SAFEBOOT_N shares it). R8 pins."
		(at 20.32 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05))
			(justify left))
		(uuid 87982715-93cc-5284-ae7b-4910f3781084))
	(text "Radio on SPI2 (R8): PB11 NSS, software (R310 100k to 3V3, at the MCU end), PB10 SCK / PB14 MOSI / PB15 MISO through R313 / R315 / R314 33R; PB14/PB15 swap by SPI_CFG2.IOSWP = 1, set while SPE = 0 before AF5. PD8 BUSY (polled), PE9 NRST (R311 2.0k to GND), PE15 DIO1 (EXTI15), PD9 RXEN (R312 100k to GND), TXEN = DIO2."
		(at 20.32 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05))
			(justify left))
		(uuid 807616b3-c39f-5d58-875a-abd85f195e42))
	(text "MCU in reset or ROM bootloader: R311 holds the radio in reset (it cannot transmit), NSS high (the loader never selects USART3 on PB10/PB11; PB10 and PB14 drive only the held radio's inputs), RXEN low, TXEN low (DIO2 pulled down in reset); the GNSS keeps tracking. PA6, PA8, PA9, PA10, PC9, PC11, PE13 NC; pyro sentinels unchanged."
		(at 20.32 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05))
			(justify left))
		(uuid 261a8e8a-58d3-5ff3-a995-3268c3d09e9f))
	(text "Radio commands can never arm or fire: no GNSS or radio net reaches pyro, ARM or actuator copper, and arming is the physical J124 link."
		(at 20.32 35.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05))
			(justify left))
		(uuid 685f6f24-8bb5-5fbd-bf26-f34c8826fc60))
	(text "Antenna bias: VCC_RF -> R300 15R sense -> Q30 (on while LNA_EN drives Q31). Q32 limits a shorted antenna or coax to about 37-48 mA at -20 C and 25-38 mA at +85 C (Inference, bench check); about 2.93 V at the antenna at 15 mA. C304 (DNP, gate to GND): fit 1-2.2 nF if the short test shows oscillation."
		(at 20.32 40.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05))
			(justify left))
		(uuid 3667c501-782b-5a7f-94f5-8755fef24f55))
	(text "RF chains: J30 -> D30 ESD103 -> L30 47nH bias tap -> C303 DNP / R304 0R / C305 DNP -> RF_IN; J31 -> D31 ESD103 -> C313 DNP / R316 0R / C314 DNP -> ANT. DNP shunts are tuning placeholders: C303 and C305 capacitive only while R304 is 0R; C313/C314 C or L. C304 capacitor only, 1.0-2.2 nF."
		(at 20.32 45.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05))
			(justify left))
		(uuid b2776ecd-44ba-5fc4-8e40-8f3230a58989))
	(text "E22: passive 32 MHz crystal, never enable DIO3 TCXO control; never transmit without an antenna or 50R load. The MAX-M10S fits U30 unchanged (fit L30 = 27nH for L1-only)."
		(at 20.32 50.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05))
			(justify left))
		(uuid 2e15f859-309f-543c-9030-c84a1ec235fb))
